## 🐍 Python Package Anatomy: `plantbreeding_py`

To ensure the Python side of the biometric engine is robust, installable, and easily integrated with the AI agent, it adheres to the standard PyPI (Python Package Index) library structure.

Below is the exact directory tree for the standalone Python package, followed by a detailed explanation of each component.

```text
core_logic/python_package/
│
├── setup.py                 # Package metadata and pip dependencies
│
└── plantbreeding_py/        # 🧠 Core Logic (The actual Python module)
    ├── __init__.py          # Module initializer and function exporter
